One woman can change the course of history

2
00:12:11,428 --> 00:12:17,428
Queen of the Desert is a drama, adventure, history
film directed by Werner Herzog.

3
00:18:17,142 --> 00:18:23,142
A chronicle of Gertrude Bell's life, a traveler, writer, archaeologist, explorer, cartographer, and political
attaché for the British Empire in the Near and Middle East at the dawn of the twentieth century.

4
00:24:22,857 --> 00:24:28,857
Her knowledge of the tribal leaders is used by the British to
establish the Kingdoms of Iraq, Jordan and Saudi Arabia.

5
